    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking over the Horizon Build waterfront proposal. The Mayor's office is pushing hard for this to go through to jumpstart the downtown area, and the city's economic forecast is looking pretty grim without it. I've been going through the environmental and geological summaries they sent over—based on those, are there any critical long-term structural risks that would justify a rejection of this proposal?",
